>any way to find out how many of a given species are left in the game?
>IOW, how close you are to extincting something?

You can do a variant on savescumming to determine this, if it is a local
game and not being played on NAO or a similar multiplayer server.

Save & Exit. Make copy of game file. Restart game. Quit. Look at creatures
killed dumplog. Restore copy of saved game. Continue.

Since you aren't using the savescumming to avoid death or identify
inventory, this is not really a very frowned on activity. Extinctionist
behavior is already pretty boring...being able to keep track of your
progress helps alleviate this. Just be sure that you aren't savescumming to
avoid death or identify your inventory...


